# HP39gs/HP40gs stock serial-disk fixture probe.
# F6 dismisses the stock boot prompt used by the direct-runtime gate.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6

# HP39 matrix aliases:
#   G/H/I -> SYMB/PLOT/NUM
#   J/K/L -> HOME/APLET/VIEWS
7000 tap aplet
8000 capture aplet-library
9000 tap f5
10000 capture receive-menu

# Walk the RECEIVE FROM chooser so the evidence shows the exact stock-ROM
# ordering before we commit the generator to one transport choice.
10500 tap down
10800 capture receive-1
11200 tap down
11500 capture receive-2
11900 tap down
12200 capture receive-3
12600 tap down
12900 capture receive-4
13300 tap down
13600 capture receive-5

# The final selection is expected to be SER. DISK DRIVE on HP39gs.
14000 tap enter
18000 capture serial-disk-active
35000 finish-install
